      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town grew into a key agricultural shipping center after the 1879 arrival of the Corpus Christi, San Diego and Rio Grande Railroad.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
